  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnership for Enhanced and Blended Learning in West Africa (PEBL)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnerships for Enhanced and Blended Learning support higher quality education through mixing traditional face-to-face teaching with online or electronic instruction and exercises. DFAT&#x2019;s contribution to this project supports a two-year capacity strengthening project in West Africa, working with universities in Ghana and Nigeria to more effectively reach and teach students across a range of disciplines.</narrative>
  </description>
